'''Ollie''' is a [[common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually for 75 [[coins]] {{Currency|Old Coin}}, or by purchasing the whole [[Skate Pack]] in the [[shop]]. It is now only obtainable through trading, as the pack has since been removed from the shop.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is solid black with three yellow overlapping circles imprinted in the center. The guard is yellow, and the handle is solid black with a skateboard imprinted on it. 

== Trivia ==
* Its texture is based off of one of Roblox’s Skate hats known as [https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Catalog:):_Gold_Ollie ): Gold Ollie].
*It is the fourth of the six knives included in the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Skate_Set Skate Set].
